# Keep PII and machine junk out of the repo.
# Any roster / contacts / phone-number data belongs in a private Google Sheet, pulled at runtime —
# NEVER committed. A noindex page is still public to anyone with the URL.
*roster*.json
*private*
.DS_Store
node_modules/
__pycache__/

# Claude Code: track .claude/settings.json (team hooks), ignore the ephemeral working dir.
.claude/.cc-writes/

# mocks/: the .dc.html artboards are committed (they embed everything they need); the
# intermediate SVGs, the PNG previews and the ~2 MB seeded canvas payload are all regenerable.
mocks/chart-*.svg
mocks/*.png
mocks/stats.json
mocks/*-directions.html

# Generated IMSLP pages (scripts/imslp-report.py, scripts/imslp-audit.py). NOT committed and not
# deployed: sw.js serves any root .html cache-first with no revalidation until a V bump, so a
# report regenerated on every pipeline run would be frozen for an installed visitor. They are
# read as artifacts or over file://, never from the site.
/imslp-coverage.html
/imslp-audit.html
